Third-party material
====================

The battinfo package includes material from the following sources. Each keeps
its own licence.


EMMO ontologies
---------------
What:    battinfo/data/context/domain-battery.context.json, a copy of the
         JSON-LD context of EMMO domain-battery 0.20.2, and the EMMO class and
         unit IRIs and labels in battinfo/data/context/, battinfo/data/mappings/
         and battinfo/data/vocab/, taken from EMMO 1.0.2, domain-battery 0.20.2,
         domain-electrochemistry 0.37.2 and domain-chemical-substance. Selected
         and rearranged for BattINFO.
From:    https://github.com/emmo-repo
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Holder:  the EMMO project (named as publisher in each ontology) and the
         ontology authors.


