OEDB solvents and anions
------------------------
What:    the choice of electrolyte solvents and anions, with OEDB's
         abbreviations, behind the substances marked "(OEDB)" in
         battinfo/data/vocab/substances.json, plus methyl acetoacetate (MAA)
         and methyl pyruvate (MPyr), which OEDB abbreviates MA and MP. Their
         identifiers come from PubChem.
From:    OEDB, the Open Electrolyte Database for Batteries, https://oedb.jp
